Involved Actions {involved-action}
{involved-action} are Final Actions that do not gain {lungs}, {charge}, or allow Investigators to place a Flashlight.
Line of Sight
The following conditions must be met in order for a space to be visible in a Flashlight:
• Flashlight fully covers the space
• 1 line touches the space without hitting an Obstacle
Wounds {blood}
These are the ways to flip {faceup-wound} face-down:
• Medical Items: One-time use, can flip {faceup-wound}
• Other: Some Abilities and cards can flip {faceup-wound}
{facedown-wound} still take up Wound slots, and you die when all of your Wound slots are full. {blood} typically cannot be removed once gained, so be careful!
